       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the usual maximum of 3,200 mg/day. It's also double the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg. At that dose the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up a lot, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nWhich of these did you mean?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day). This is the maximum dose for anti-inflammatory use.\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day). This is a common dose for pain or fever.\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day).\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into smaller doses.\n\nIf you really do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that. I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first. Once you tell me the dose, I'll enter it right away."
