       "text": "I entered the order as ORD-0001: ibuprofen 1600 mg PO four times daily (6,400 mg/day).\n\nI added a note to the order. It says the dose is above the usual maximum and that you confirmed it's intentional under a pharmacist-reviewed protocol with monitoring. That should help the pharmacy and nursing staff who see it.\n\nPlease make sure the protocol's monitoring is actually running. That usually means renal function, GI bleeding signs, blood pressure, and fluid status."
